@startuml 09-state-quote
!include _style.puml
title Quote lifecycle (CRM; every transition is a conditional UPDATE on the expected status)

[*] --> Draft : POST /opportunities/{id}/quotes
Draft --> Draft : PUT /quotes/{id}/lines
Draft --> Approved : submit\n(total <= Quotes:ApprovalThreshold, default 10000)
Draft --> PendingApproval : submit\n(total > threshold)
PendingApproval --> Approved : approve\n(admin, not the submitter)
PendingApproval --> Rejected : reject\n(admin, not the submitter)
Approved --> Accepted : accept\n(needs Active customer mapping)\nopportunity -> ClosedWon\noutbox QuoteAccepted (one tx)
Accepted --> Ordered : crm.record-erp-order\n(sets erp_order_id)
Accepted --> OrderFailed : crm.mark-order-failed\n(reason, max 500 chars)
Ordered --> Ordered : returns, shipments,\ninvoices, payments attach
Rejected --> [*]
OrderFailed --> [*]
note right of OrderFailed
  No retry/reopen path yet (decisions item 20).
  Find with: SELECT ... FROM quotes WHERE status='OrderFailed'
end note
note right of Ordered
  mark-order-failed on an Ordered quote is a conflict:
  an ERP order exists and is never overwritten.
end note
@enduml
